---@field AddOrUpdate? aws.mwaa.TeamMap A map of teams to add to your environment, or to update if they already exist. Each entry maps a team name to its settings. Each team name must match the display name of an Amazon Web Services IAM Identity Center group associated with your environment. You can configure between 1 and 20 teams.
---@field Remove? aws.mwaa.TeamNameList A list of team names to remove from your environment. For example, team-a. You can remove between 1 and 20 teams in a single update. Removing a team does not delete the team's DAG code from Amazon S3.

